   "request": "Correct usage(cli, raw) for fresh non-resumed single-shot native CLI streams. Claude assistant output counters are placeholders. Canonical counts must sum final result.modelUsage query-pipeline models; retain result.usage as mainLoopCounts and deduplicated diagnostics as transcriptCounts. Preserve coding identity observedModels separately from accountingModels; countsSource names claude.result.modelUsage. Return counts=None and explicit non-observed accountingStatus for missing/duplicate final results, malformed JSON, missing/negative/non-integer/boolean counters or pipeline counters below main-loop counters. Valid auxiliary model totals may exceed the main loop. Preserve existing input/output/cacheRead/cacheWrite shapes. Codex retains completed-turn input_tokens/cached_input_tokens/output_tokens, rejects invalid counters and cached input above input. Missing usage must never fall back to transcript totals or imply zero cost. Preserve all original qualification and immutable-receipt behavior. Invalid assistant diagnostic counters must not mask valid final native pipeline totals; expose transcriptDiagnosticError separately. Valid native accounting uses accountingStatus='observed'. Return sorted unique observedModels and accountingModels. For invalid assistant diagnostics, transcriptDiagnosticError='invalid-assistant-diagnostic' while parseErrors counts malformed JSON only.",
